{
    "version": "4.43.1",
    "description": "网易UU远程（GameViewer）：超低延迟的远程控制工具，支持 Windows / macOS / iOS / Android / TV",
    "homepage": "https://uuyc.163.com/",
    "license": "Freeware",
    "url": "https://a56.gdl.netease.com/UURemote_Setup_4.43.1.3614_1016022822_gwqd.exe",
    "hash": "sha256:9a69473798ad4861b966607859adbba9c8d1b2a2a0ea9e22bba7f14969656263",
    "pre_install": [
        "Expand-7zipArchive (Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\*.exe\" | Select-Object -First 1).FullName \"$dir\\_extract\"",
        "$sub = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\_extract\" -Directory | Where-Object { $_.Name -like '*37*' } | Select-Object -First 1",
        "if ($sub) { Move-Item \"$($sub.FullName)\\*\" \"$dir\" -Force } else { Move-Item \"$dir\\_extract\\*\" \"$dir\" -Force }",
        "Remove-Item \"$dir\\_extract\" -Recurse -Force"
    ],
    "bin": "GameViewer.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "GameViewer.exe",
            "网易UU远程"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "免安装便携版：NSIS 安装包用 7z 解包后拍平载荷目录（$dir 根为程序本体，主程序 GameViewer.exe）。",
        "官方下载地址包含每版变化的构建号与签名参数，暂无可靠的自动更新源；升级请重新运行收录流程。"
    ]
}
